# data/* not data/ — git cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded,
# so the negations below only work if the directory itself stays un-ignored.
data/*
# Held-out test split (20.9 MB) so notebook 02 runs from a fresh clone, plus the
# three FRED series (public domain). The 1.6 GB raw Kaggle CSV stays out —
# see the Configuration Manual for its download URL.
!data/X_test.parquet
!data/y_test.parquet
!data/UNRATE.csv
!data/CPIAUCSL.csv
!data/FEDFUNDS.csv

